Hypothetical reconstruction of the six-fracture model
of Wang, Vuik and Hajibeygi.

Domain:
x = [0,6] m
y = [0,6] m
z = [0,0.1] m

origin is assumed to be the centre of each rectangular fracture.
Each fracture spans the complete thin z-direction.
-->

